### Without a login: 401 (run `npm run watch` first)
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/claims/Claims

### alice is a built-in mocked user with the role admin; her password is empty
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/claims/Claims
Authorization: Basic YWxpY2U6

### bob is a built-in mocked user without the role admin
PATCH http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/claims/Claims(11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111)
Authorization: Basic Ym9iOg==
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 50 }
